  <ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl id="f-36" contextRef="c-1">We are a Michigan general partnership created pursuant to a partnership agreement entered into on August 2, 1991, between Blue Lake Holdings, Inc. and ANR Blue Lake Company, an indirect subsidiary of TC Energy Corporation, with each partner originally owning a 50 percent interest in us.&#160; On January 1, 1998 ANR Blue Lake Company acquired an additional 25 percent interest from Blue Lake Holdings, Inc., increasing its interest in us to 75 percent.&#160; Blue Lake Holdings, Inc. continues its ownership of the remaining 25 percent interest.&#160; We allocate net income to our partners based on their ownership interest; however, voting rights remain equal since all decisions of the partnership require the approval of both partners.&#160; ANR Storage Company, the direct parent of ANR Blue Lake Company, is designated as the operator of the facility.</ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl>
  <ferc:AttestationName id="f-37" contextRef="c-1">Jayson Antolin</ferc:AttestationName>
